Package: com.pank.carrierlocktext
Name: Carrier Locked change to Unlocked
Version: 1.0.6
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: A tiny, fun UI tweak that changes "SIM locked" to "No SIM restrictions" in Settings.
 No magic and no real carrier unlock: it only changes the text and interaction shown in the Settings app. The SIM, baseband and actual carrier-lock state stay exactly the same.
Maintainer: Nam Pank
Author: Nam Pank
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
